It's not a trait found in most primate species.

00:26:52.780 --> 00:26:53.640
Including Ms. Indy?

00:26:54.260 --> 00:26:59.500
There's a reason reptilians are called upon when force must be applied.

00:27:00.920 --> 00:27:04.500
It was a reptilian who piloted the weapon that attacked your world.

00:27:04.750 --> 00:27:05.370
Friend of yours?

00:27:06.240 --> 00:27:07.620
He was from my regiment.

00:27:08.760 --> 00:27:10.340
I selected him myself.

00:27:10.970 --> 00:27:12.290
You must be very proud.

00:27:12.670 --> 00:27:14.510
His name will go down in history.

00:27:14.670 --> 00:27:22.100
It will be spoken with reverence, a testament to the superiority of the cold-blooded.

00:27:23.250 --> 00:27:28.320
I'll bet you didn't know this, but at one time, most of my world was ruled by reptiles.

00:27:28.810 --> 00:27:29.810
I wasn't aware.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:38.020
of that a comet hit around 65 million years ago caused a mass extinction most of the reptiles died

00:27:38.020 --> 00:27:45.320
out mammals became the dominant species how unfortunate still the reptiles might have come

00:27:45.320 --> 00:27:52.060
out on top if it hadn't been for a slight disadvantage and what was that they had brains

00:27:52.060 --> 00:27:57.580
the size of a walnut that's very small apparently

00:28:00.410 --> 00:28:02.030
It's a constant in the universe.

00:28:06.370 --> 00:28:07.030
We're vessels.

00:28:07.530 --> 00:28:13.680
The cows didn't all die out.

00:28:14.830 --> 00:28:19.140
Some evolved into snakes, alligators, turtles.

00:28:19.950 --> 00:28:25.000
As a matter of fact, one of my favorite restaurants in San Francisco makes the most wonderful turtle soup.

00:28:25.740 --> 00:28:28.220
You should try it sometime if you're ever in the area.

00:28:31.560 --> 00:28:42.740
want me to kill you making conversation relaying a few interesting facts about the world you're

00:28:42.740 --> 00:28:55.070
trying to destroy i'll reciprocate with an interesting fact of my own know exactly where

00:28:55.070 --> 00:28:55.930
your ship is

00:29:01.400 --> 00:29:03.700
When we lost contact with our lunar outpost,

00:29:03.880 --> 00:29:07.990
we scanned the vicinity and discovered it.

00:29:09.270 --> 00:29:10.110
Hiding.

00:29:12.470 --> 00:29:15.970
Lest you tell me exactly what I want to know,

00:29:16.770 --> 00:29:21.320
I'll dispatch a squadron right now.

00:29:26.380 --> 00:29:28.570
More conversation, hmm?

00:29:33.360 --> 00:29:36.320
You had a chance to say goodbye to your crew.

00:29:37.610 --> 00:29:43.160
All right, but I'll only talk to Degra.

00:29:45.690 --> 00:29:46.110
Degra?

00:29:46.290 --> 00:29:46.590
Alone.

00:29:49.190 --> 00:29:49.870
Who that is?

00:29:50.100 --> 00:29:51.460
He's building your weapon.

00:29:52.970 --> 00:29:53.910
Ring a bell now?

00:29:55.550 --> 00:29:59.330
What makes you think Degra would be interested in talking to you?

00:30:01.370 --> 00:30:06.700
Just tell him the name of his third child, Trenia.

00:30:08.320 --> 00:30:10.140
Degra has only two children.

00:30:10.620 --> 00:30:11.740
Prove me wrong.

00:30:13.070 --> 00:30:13.530
Tell him.

00:30:15.130 --> 00:30:19.860
Sensors would have easily detected an explosion of that magnitude, even underwater.

00:30:20.810 --> 00:30:24.600
I say we go in, get as close as we can, and try to take out the weapon.

00:30:24.760 --> 00:30:25.100
Agreed.

00:30:26.410 --> 00:30:27.760
This system is heavily guarded.

00:30:28.040 --> 00:30:29.980
Our chances of reaching the weapon are non-exha-

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:31.920
We can't just sit here.

00:30:32.100 --> 00:30:33.930
What do you propose we do?

00:30:35.700 --> 00:30:37.540
There's still a chance the captain may succeed.

00:30:38.800 --> 00:30:41.860
The longer we wait here, the greater the likelihood we'll be spotted.

00:30:45.170 --> 00:30:46.830
If we don't hear from the captain in one hour,

00:30:49.100 --> 00:30:50.860
I'll pilot a shuttle pod into the system.

00:30:52.210 --> 00:30:52.630
And do what?

00:30:54.040 --> 00:30:55.380
Attempt a diplomatic solution.

00:30:55.880 --> 00:30:56.660
You've got to be kidding.

00:30:57.240 --> 00:30:59.800
You can't possibly believe that that has any chance of success.

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:04.780
The odds aren't promising, but the fact that I'm Vulcan may help me establish a dialogue.

00:31:06.510 --> 00:31:08.450
Just be chid. Killed.

00:31:08.740 --> 00:31:11.930
Perhaps, but at the moment I don't see an alternate course of action.

00:31:20.940 --> 00:31:26.000
Well again, how do you know me?

00:31:28.090 --> 00:31:29.880
Long story, repeat.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:31.270
What you told him.

00:31:32.380 --> 00:31:33.920
The name of your third child, Trinia.

00:31:40.860 --> 00:31:41.740
Leave me alone with him.

00:31:43.820 --> 00:31:44.680
Take him as well.

00:32:01.720 --> 00:32:04.640
Three months into the pregnancy, your wife contracted anaprolean fever.

00:32:05.430 --> 00:32:06.650
You lost the child.

00:32:07.710 --> 00:32:08.890
You were going to name it Trenia.

00:32:14.870 --> 00:32:17.990
You also talked about the weapon you designed.

00:32:18.130 --> 00:32:19.630
The one that killed 7 million people.

00:32:20.740 --> 00:32:24.760
When you watched the telemetry come in, you wondered how many of those 7 million were children.

00:32:26.360 --> 00:32:26.880
Who are you?

00:32:27.060 --> 00:32:29.580
It doesn't matter who I am or how I know all this.

00:32:30.120 --> 00:32:32.340
What's important is that you listen to what I have to say.

00:32:34.430 --> 00:32:34.750
Continue.

00:32:38.300 --> 00:32:42.570
Your reason for building this weapon is based on a lie.

00:32:43.330 --> 00:32:44.590
What lie would that be?

00:32:44.800 --> 00:32:49.080
That at some point in the future, humans are going to destroy your species.

00:32:49.440 --> 00:32:51.340
That is not a lie.

00:32:52.790 --> 00:32:53.770
You know about the spheres.

00:32:54.010 --> 00:32:58.790
They were constructed by trans-dimensional beings.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:03.840
Their purpose is to reconfigure the Expanse to make it habitable for their species.

00:33:04.770 --> 00:33:07.670
That's what destroys the Zindi, not humanity.

00:33:07.870 --> 00:33:09.010
I've studied the spheres.

00:33:09.230 --> 00:33:11.770
There is no evidence to support what you're saying.

00:33:11.890 --> 00:33:12.810
I've seen it happen.

00:33:15.600 --> 00:33:16.620
I've been to the future.

00:33:17.950 --> 00:33:20.050
400 years into the future.

00:33:20.190 --> 00:33:22.590
You ask me to believe that?

00:33:26.620 --> 00:33:26.960
Fatima.

00:33:30.760 --> 00:33:31.260
Go ahead.

00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:41.750
An initiation medal.

00:33:42.780 --> 00:33:43.600
Have it cornundated.

00:33:45.210 --> 00:33:46.410
The results will back me up.

00:33:47.140 --> 00:33:48.680
You could have gotten it anywhere.

00:33:48.880 --> 00:33:50.160
Listen to me, you son of a bitch.

00:33:50.480 --> 00:33:53.590
It wasn't any easier for me to swallow this than it is for you.

00:33:53.750 --> 00:33:54.990
But you better understand something.

00:33:56.070 --> 00:33:59.200
If you destroy Earth, you won't just be eliminating my species.

00:33:59.600 --> 00:33:59.980
You'll be...

00:34:00.020 --> 00:34:19.410
eliminating your own. Dating confirms it. It's from the future. That doesn't prove the humans

00:34:19.410 --> 00:34:26.200
telling the truth. If there's any truth in what he's saying, we can't trust her. It also means

00:34:26.200 --> 00:34:29.820
she's been dealing with the reptilian secret. Archer told you this?

00:34:30.190 --> 00:34:36.520
He said he saw reptilians on Earth in a place called Detroit over a hundred years in the past.

00:34:37.340 --> 00:34:37.940
The past?

00:34:38.190 --> 00:34:40.050
So now he's a time traveler.

00:34:40.470 --> 00:34:43.750
According to the human, they were developing a bioweapon.

00:34:45.070 --> 00:34:46.310
Council prohibited that.

00:34:46.490 --> 00:34:48.610
He spoke of it in great detail.

00:34:50.000 --> 00:34:54.720
If the reptilians wanted to keep their actions a secret, the past would be a good place to do it.

00:34:55.720 --> 00:34:57.120
How would they get to the past?

00:34:59.620 --> 00:34:59.820
Chi.

00:35:00.540 --> 00:35:01.320
May have taken them.

00:35:02.870 --> 00:35:04.090
We have to investigate this.

00:35:04.170 --> 00:35:04.610
Then quickly.

00:35:05.080 --> 00:35:08.000
The weapon's been moved to a safe location, but it's nearly ready to be deployed.

00:35:08.200 --> 00:35:10.020
The council must be informed.

00:35:10.810 --> 00:35:12.990
Reptilians sit on the council, or have you forgotten?

00:35:14.320 --> 00:35:17.240
If they did go behind our backs, we shouldn't reveal what we've learned.

00:35:17.760 --> 00:35:18.280
Not yet.

00:35:18.790 --> 00:35:19.950
What about the aquatics?

00:35:20.570 --> 00:35:22.130
We can inform them in secret.

00:35:23.540 --> 00:35:26.550
All of this collusion is dangerous.

00:35:27.530 --> 00:35:28.950
The council is fracturing.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.440
We can't forget who the real enemy is.

00:35:33.820 --> 00:35:37.020
We may not know who the real enemy is.

00:35:37.180 --> 00:35:41.660
What happens if you fail?

00:35:42.390 --> 00:35:44.530
Are we supposed to just keep sending people in until there's no one left?

00:35:45.060 --> 00:35:48.220
That's hardly a viable option. We only have one more shuttle pod.

00:35:49.600 --> 00:35:50.960
You're missing my point.

00:35:51.160 --> 00:35:55.910
You're doing this to make peace. I think you want to try and save the captain.

00:35:56.010 --> 00:35:56.450
You're wrong.

00:35:56.850 --> 00:35:58.710
Why do I get the feeling you haven't thought this through?

00:35:58.970 --> 00:35:59.970
You have made your ob...

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:02.080
Objection is clear. Now return to the bridge.

00:36:02.420 --> 00:36:04.770
I'm not just going to sit still and watch you fly off and die.

00:36:04.850 --> 00:36:05.550
I gave you an order.

00:36:05.730 --> 00:36:05.890
DePaul.

00:36:06.430 --> 00:36:07.210
Let go of me.

00:36:07.270 --> 00:36:07.930
I won't let you do this.

00:36:08.030 --> 00:36:08.750
I said let go!

00:36:09.290 --> 00:36:10.430
What the hell is wrong with you?

00:36:10.630 --> 00:36:12.020
Bridge to DePaul.

00:36:15.060 --> 00:36:18.850
go ahead there's no need to go to the zindi it appears they're coming to us

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:30.900
Closing fast.

00:36:31.910 --> 00:36:32.490
Hail them.

00:36:36.790 --> 00:36:37.350
No response.

00:36:38.050 --> 00:36:38.770
They're charging weapons.

00:36:41.750 --> 00:36:43.110
What exactly are you proposing?

00:36:46.940 --> 00:36:47.600
Trust each other.

00:36:49.610 --> 00:36:53.210
Captured behind the controls of a ship armed with explosives.

00:36:54.390 --> 00:36:56.050
You're asking for our trust.

00:36:57.210 --> 00:36:59.070
You're building a weapon that could destroy my world.

00:37:00.920 --> 00:37:13.930
stop you and now that your missions fail you want to negotiate just consider what i said you maintain

00:37:13.930 --> 00:37:14.590
that

00:37:15.000 --> 00:37:18.440
By destroying your world, we'll be ensuring our own annihilation.

00:37:19.140 --> 00:37:19.540
That's right.

00:37:20.310 --> 00:37:26.620
Because it's humankind that ultimately saves the Xindi from these spear builders.

00:37:26.880 --> 00:37:29.150
We're both fighting the wrong enemy.

00:37:30.800 --> 00:37:36.320
I'm afraid it'll take more than this antique to convince us.

00:37:36.830 --> 00:37:39.210
Quantuminating has produced inaccurate results before.

00:37:40.540 --> 00:37:42.300
Do you believe these results are inaccurate?

00:37:42.660 --> 00:37:48.140
Let me speak to this council of yours.

00:37:48.830 --> 00:37:49.630
Present my case.

00:37:49.950 --> 00:37:52.490
Some members of the council would sooner execute you than listen.

00:37:53.000 --> 00:37:54.520
Then help me change their minds.

00:37:54.760 --> 00:37:56.080
You haven't changed ours.

00:37:58.530 --> 00:37:58.790
I should.

00:38:01.148 --> 00:38:03.148
you wouldn't still be here.

00:39:11.932 --> 00:39:12.332
Strange.

00:39:13.724 --> 00:39:14.564
We're not finished.

00:39:15.100 --> 00:39:16.380
You've had enough time.

00:39:18.300 --> 00:39:20.860
Has he revealed the location of his forces?

00:39:20.924 --> 00:39:22.684
We've been discussing other matters.

00:39:22.844 --> 00:39:24.824
There are no other matters.

00:39:26.492 --> 00:39:27.672
Take them back to their ship.

00:39:27.996 --> 00:39:28.596
We're not gone.

00:39:28.700 --> 00:39:29.100
Anywhere.

00:39:33.360 --> 00:39:34.720
You can't threaten us.

00:39:34.840 --> 00:39:36.080
Return to your ship.

00:39:37.400 --> 00:39:38.060
What about him?

00:39:38.890 --> 00:39:42.290
He's going to a detention center for more questioning.

00:39:43.640 --> 00:39:47.820
If there are any survivors from his ship, they'll join him.

00:39:48.990 --> 00:39:49.590
Survivors?

00:39:49.930 --> 00:39:51.410
Your ship's under attack.

00:39:52.840 --> 00:39:55.480
We grew tired of waiting.

00:39:55.760 --> 00:39:56.500
Call off your vessels.

00:39:56.700 --> 00:39:57.920
I don't answer to you.

00:39:58.160 --> 00:39:59.500
I'll assemble the council.

00:39:59.640 --> 00:39:59.980
By the time...

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:02.340
Every time you do, the Earthship will be dust.

00:41:01.210 --> 00:41:01.610
Wait.
